# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the op-fusion programme's four-card window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/fusion-1 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-fusion-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# TWAL1 (TIMED, tile-aligned drafter window, RB): the LEVER (B1): the production profile plus QWEN_FAST_TAP_WINDOW_ALIGNED=1; eight live (concurrent8_steady) in the first
# pair of the ABAB, every boot a fresh reset. READ: c2_smoke_check clean (a lever arm also has its engaged line and no fell-back line), no stall; then PAIRED per round,
# never by unpaired medians: python3 scripts/ci/w2ln_timing_compare.py pair <A container log> <B container log> --window steady --a-smoke <A smoke log> --b-smoke <B smoke
# log> for (TWAC1, TWAL1) and (TWAC2, TWAL2), and its floor subcommand over the two control logs; the texts equal (text_mismatches empty). the five tap windows [P-2048, P)
# are snapshotted as tile-aligned pieces and joined by one tiled concat (fixed 2080 rows) and one slice at (P-2048) mod 32, instead of a concat of unaligned pieces whose
# untilize/concat/retilize programs (and untilize writer kernels) are keyed by the split; data movement only, so bit-identical (the audit compares today's composition on
# every chip). Duration (estimate): 35 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-twa
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady
